## Loom video

Not recorded yet; this PR is a draft. Each case below links to a silent screen recording of the real Obsidian window, driven over CDP on head `1c036bad`. The red dot is the cursor, input is slowed for viewing, and every recorded check passed. The clips are hosted in the discourse-dev-graph Roam graph and download when clicked. **CDP** marks cases from the original 35-check run; **new** marks cases scripted for this checklist.

<details><summary>Test cases with recordings</summary>

**1. Drag preview (`DiscourseToolPanel`)**
- [ ] CDP: drag a node type off the panel. The 50×50 label follows the cursor, hides over the panel, and dropping opens the modal. {T1.1}
- [ ] CDP: Escape mid-drag cancels {T1.2}. A plain click never shows the preview {T1.3}.

**2. Node modal (`ModifyNodeModal`).** For each route with a popover, the list sits under the title (`position: fixed`, +8px).
- [ ] CDP: command "Create discourse node". Popover {T2.1}, title grows {T2.2}, auto-height {T2.5}, keyboard pick {T2.6}.
- [ ] CDP: command "Convert current page to discourse node" (no popover) {T2.4}
- [ ] CDP: canvas tool click {T1.3} and panel drag-drop {T1.1}
- [ ] CDP: canvas double-click a node (edit) {T5.2}
- [ ] new: editor right-click → "Turn into discourse node" {P1}
- [ ] new: node-tag hotkey `\` → pick a type {P2}
- [ ] new: hover a node tag → "Create Evidence" {P3}
- [ ] new: hover an embedded image → "Convert to node" {P4}
- [ ] new: file explorer "Convert into" on a note {P5a} and on an image {P5b} (no popover)
- [ ] new: canvas right-click "Convert To" on a text shape {P6a} and on an image shape {P6b}
- [ ] Not recorded: with a community theme or CSS snippet, the popover still sits under the title.

**3. Relationship section (`RelationshipSection`)**
- [ ] CDP: sidebar chips {T3.1}, switching type {T3.2}, single option {T3.3}, cancel and reopen {T3.4}, settings change {T3.6}
- [ ] CDP: wikilink badge popover in Live Preview {T3.5}
- [ ] new: wikilink badge popover in Reading view {P7}

**4. Schema selection (`useSchemaSelection`)**
- [ ] CDP: export defaults {T4.1}
- [ ] CDP: import resets on a new file {T4.2}, re-picking the same file {T4.3}, rapid toggles {T4.4}

**5. Node shape loading (`DiscourseNodeShape`)**
- [ ] CDP: canvas fixture {C0}, rename {T5.2}, key image {T5.3}, a size change doesn't resize {T5.4}, title from the store {T5.5}
- [ ] new: Context tab → "Add this relation to canvas" (the load effect sizes the node) {P8}
- [ ] new: drag a wikilink handle onto the canvas {P9}
- [ ] new: rename a note while its canvas is closed, then reopen {P10}

**6. Relation indicator (`DiscourseRelationShape`)**
- [ ] CDP: labelled relation hover, select, edit, Escape {T6.1-6.3}
- [ ] new: an unlabelled relation keeps the path indicator while editing {P11}
- [ ] new: create a relation from a node's drag handles {P12}
